Fixes applied from code review:

- **Removed** redundant `fs.accessSync` check (flush already handles missing files gracefully)
- **Added** error logging to all catch blocks — no more silent swallowing
- **Pass object directly** to `check-frontmatter.run()` instead of re-serializing to JSON
- **Anchored path checks** to `REPO_ROOT` — no false matches from `library/` appearing in unrelated paths
- **Reduced debounce** from 5s to 3s to fit comfortably within the 10s async hook timeout